{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15549","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 丁位","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小苑春初望，宫池柳色轻。\n低昂含晓景，萦转带新晴。\n似盖芳初合，如丝荫渐成。\n依依连水暗，嫋嫋出墙明。\n虽以阳和发，能令旅思生。\n他时花满路，从此接迁莺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丁位","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}